  "summary": "书目注释交代沐浴说及太岁、婚姻论述来源，出版年份不作命盘时间。古引文把天同卯酉、庚年和特定年支连到夭亡，作者随后仅说明天同坐命多吉少煞相对有利健康，多忌煞不利；不把传统断语当现实诊断。",
  "summary_en": "The notes identify teaching and publications behind bathing, Tai Sui and marriage interpretations; publication years are not chart periods. An ancient quotation links Tian Tong at Mao or You, Geng births and selected branches to early death. The author then gives a qualified health interpretation: many benefics with few or no malefics are comparatively favorable, whereas numerous adverse influences are unfavorable. These are traditional claims, not a medical diagnosis.",
